  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: OCTOBER 16, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa October 16, 2026 (Friday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: October 16, 2026 (Friday)\nReason: Relocation of one 30ft. Obstructing secondary concrete pole into lot boundary.\nTime & Affected Areas:\n10:00AM to 2:00PM\nPortion of AF1 - Portion along St. Peter Subd., Brgy. Tangub, Bacolod City.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
